		{
			dependencies: ["00000000000000AF"]
			description: [
				"&2Extreme Reactors&r 是 &eBig Reactors&r 模组的原始移植版。"
				""
				"用巨型反应堆 harness 原子的力量，还是用强大的 &a涡轮机&r 将蒸汽转化为能量？为什么不两者兼得呢？"
				""
				"Build huge &o&bmultiblock machines&r to produce produce energy in a very efficient way. &2Extreme Reactor&r support natively the &cForge Energy Power&r system with the &cForge Energy Power Taps&r so you would be able to power the vast majority of modded machines. The mod is designed in such a way that, if needed, more power system &o&bcan be supported&r."
			]
